{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽親自教授一道「香茅椰奶雞」。這次的食譜破格不使用咖喱，而是利用香茅、檸檬葉及魚露來帶出風味。菜式散發出陣陣香茅幽香，吃起來帶有濃郁的椰奶味！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3f475ded-9f9a-4424-bdfe-38e70bb22f78.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026b0VARm7qTB1787045300.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3f475ded-9f9a-4424-bdfe-38e70bb22f78.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>準備食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">雞肉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香茅</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">薑</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">檸檬葉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紅蘿蔔</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">椰奶</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">魚露</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">醃料：生抽、紹興酒、生粉、糖</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>香茅椰奶雞做法（5步完成）</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9828a1bf-3fb9-43b5-95df-c5e2482baea2.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026K1I5BguP2H1787045300.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9828a1bf-3fb9-43b5-95df-c5e2482baea2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>肥媽入廚小貼士</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T09:56:29.333746+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}